  3049	# v9 CARROT: plant carrots instead of wheat when the carrot book pays for it.
  3050	#
  3051	# The tape replants wheat on the same short cycle a carrot needs (water daily,
  3052	# harvest at age 2-4), so the swap keeps every worker's schedule intact.  A
  3053	# watered wheat plant yields 4 and a carrot 3, for $10 more seed, so the swap
  3054	# only pays once the carrot quote clears V9_CARROT_RATIO x the wheat quote --
  3055	# which pet cafes and farmers markets make happen by draining the hinge book.
  3056	# Wheat is also feed, so the swap stops while the shed holds less than
  3057	# V9_CARROT_WHEAT_RESERVE wheat.
