  3407	# v9/2 PREDICT: forecast the rival's premium sales from a library of recorded
  3408	# streams and sell our planned lots just before theirs.
  3409	#
  3410	# Each turn the rival's executed sales are recovered exactly like RACE does
  3411	# (inventory delta + town draw - own sales).  Library streams with the same
  3412	# first two shops are scored against the rival's recovered sale ticks of the last
  3413	# 240 turns; when most of the best TOP streams sell >= K units of a product in the
  3414	# next two turns, our tape's planned sales of that product within H turns are
  3415	# sold now.
  3490	    cands = _v92_p_pair(shops)
